            "evidence": "`result = ModuleType(...)` followed immediately by `del result.__spec__` with no guard.",
            "file_path": "hypothesis/src/hypothesis/internal/reflection.py",
            "finding": "`del result.__spec__` unconditionally removes the attribute; if a future/other Python does not set `__spec__` in the module's instance dict (it is not guaranteed to be settable/deletable across implementations), this raises AttributeError at module-creation time for every dynamically compiled function.",
